      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the launch strategy for a new ultra-premium fragrance line. We're aiming for the top 1% of the market. Can you help me outline a few detailed consumer personas for this? I need to know their lifestyle, what they value, and their general demographic/cultural backgrounds so we can tailor the imagery and ad placement correctly.",
